OL,3,GNEWSAEx-Grenfell housing chief given
OL,4,Anew council role
OL,5,
OL,6,FBereaved families and Grenfell
OL,7,Fsurvivors have criticised the
OL,8,Fappointment of a former Royal Borough
OL,9,Fof Kensington and Chelsea (RBKC)
OL,10,Fhousing chief - to a senior role at
OL,11,Fanother London authority.
OL,13,FOne survivor called the move a "slap in
OL,14,Fthe face" for accountability over the
OL,15,Fdisaster, which killed 72 people in
OL,16,FJune 2017.
OL,18,FLaura Johnson was housing director at
OL,19,Fthe west London council at the time of
OL,20,Fthe fire, but has now been appointed by
OL,21,FThe Barnet Group, which manages social
OL,22,Fhousing for Barnet Council.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
